  "body": "* 4 bedrooms | 2 bathrooms + guest toilet | 1 lounge | 1 office | 1 internal-access garage\r\n* Approx. 167sqm floor area on an approx. 195sqm freehold section\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living with excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Master suite with ensuite, wardrobe and private balcony\r\n* Additional upstairs sitting area for added flexibility\r\n* Central air conditioning, underfloor heating in bathrooms and pre-wired EV charging\r\n* Excellent afternoon sunshine and peaceful reserve outlook\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nBright, modern and designed for easy everyday living, this brand-new home at 327 Te Taruna Drive offers a thoughtful layout with flexible spaces to suit the changing needs of modern family life.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a welcoming space for everyday living and entertaining. The contemporary kitchen is both stylish and practical, with generous bench space, quality appliances and excellent storage. Sliding doors connect the living area to the outdoor deck, extending the space for relaxed weekends, summer entertaining or simply enjoying the afternoon sunshine.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, an additional sitting area provides valuable flexibility - whether used as a children's retreat, reading corner, study space or somewhere to simply unwind. The master bedroom enjoys its own private balcony, along with an ensuite and wardrobe, offering a peaceful space to start or end the day. Three further bedrooms and a well-appointed family bathroom provide comfortable accommodation for family and guests.\r\n\r\nThoughtful extras add to the home's everyday appeal, including central air conditioning for year-round comfort, underfloor heating in the bathrooms, a ground-floor guest toilet, intercom and pre-wiring for an EV charger. The internal-access single garage also incorporates convenient storage and a laundry nook.\r\n\r\nSet in the growing Milldale community, you'll be close to local schools, parks, walking tracks, cafés, shops and motorway access. Combining modern comfort, sunny living and versatile spaces, this brand-new home is ready for you to move in and make it your own.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
